  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, lattice existence construction.

    <item>Status: draft; mathematical and Lean-correspondence reviews
    pending.

    <item>Imported source revision, recorded in
    <verbatim|source/upstream.json>: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Authoritative mathematical text:
    <verbatim|manuscript/existence/free-kernel-estimates.tex>.

    <item>This chapter proves the analytic-cube-to-Fourier-strip estimate,
    finite-residue power counting, and centered-carry difference identity. It
    gives the actual branch formulas and reconstructs the branch algebra and
    reciprocal overlap argument. Companion
    <verbatim|free-kernel-components.tex> proves the component weights and
    finite-history train induction.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Exact input and notation crosswalk><label|exact-input-and-notation-crosswalk>

